Vibrational entropy               ...      0.00002331 Eh      0.01 kcal/mol
Rotational entropy                ...      0.00507759 Eh      3.19 kcal/mol
Translational entropy             ...      0.01608942 Eh     10.10 kcal/mol
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
